# Dev server

Do **not** start, restart, or stop the local server from the terminal unless the user explicitly asks.

- Do not run `npm run dev`, `astro dev`, `npx astro dev`, or any other command that boots a long-running local server
- Do not kill or restart an already-running server
- Assume localhost is already up if browser verification is needed
- If the app is not reachable, say so and wait for the user to start it — do not start it yourself

```bash
# ❌ BAD — starting the server unprompted
npm run dev

# ✅ GOOD — only when the user said to start it
npm run dev
```
